  displayName: The Club on Third
  description: 
  text: By now the calendar runs itself - Tuesdays, the house parties, the coffeehouse
    guy who finally started calling you. The talent show is the one night that isn't
    routine, and you win it anyway. A woman who books the club on Third finds you
    at the load-out and asks what else you've got. Dave's already got the van running.
